# NOTICE — castctl web UI

## Fork statement

The castctl web UI (`webui/`) is a fork of the frontend of
[router-for-me/Cli-Proxy-API-Management-Center](https://github.com/router-for-me/Cli-Proxy-API-Management-Center)
at commit `64b4f5aed19b8f791eb21eb9e785ea379ea05b44` (2026-10-26), licensed
under the MIT License reproduced verbatim below.

Kept from upstream (adapted only where noted): the React + TypeScript +
Vite build, `vite-plugin-singlefile` single-file output, theme and layout
styles (including the mobile off-canvas sidebar mechanism), shared UI
components (Button, Card, Table, Modal, Input, ToggleSwitch, EmptyState,
NotificationContainer, PageTransition), the i18next mechanism, the
CodeMirror editor integration, and the diff-before-save pattern.

Replaced for castctl: all pages (Dashboard, Profiles, Outbounds,
Endpoints, Config Editor, Logs, System, Settings, Login, screencast
Login shell), the API client (now a fetch wrapper against castctl's own
`/api/v1`, no axios), the auth store (sessionStorage token, no obfuscated
persistent storage), all locale strings (English + Vietnamese only), and
all branding (castctl).

Removed: the upstream provider/OAuth/quota/plugin domain (pages, stores,
services, hooks, utils), the upstream test suite (replaced by vitest
tests in `webui/tests/`), and upstream branding assets.

